2. Mere hisaab se iska permanent solution kya hai?
Main existing HOMIO Control Center, ACRL aur CI ko use karunga. Koi doosra AI engine, duplicate Control Center ya naya master plan nahi banaunga.

Layer 1 — Repository truth gate

Code likhne se pehle exact live HEAD, current task, file content, blob SHA, imports, consumers aur existing tests read kiye jayenge. Har target ka clear decision hoga: ADD, UPDATE, VERIFY, NO CHANGE ya BLOCKED.

Rule: Kisi GPT ko guessed filename, imaginary API ya unseen function ke basis par implementation dene ki permission nahi.



Layer 2 — Contract-first implementation

Har task ke required behavior ko exact interfaces aur test cases se bind kiya jayega. Tests sirf yeh nahi poochhenge ki file compile hoti hai; woh check karenge ki real modules ek doosre ko sahi tarah call karte hain.

Example: authenticated request → tenant authorization → approved provider → usage reservation/accounting → validated response. Har important failure path bhi test hoga.



Layer 3 — Implementation conformance gate

Existing GitHub Actions mein task ke required behavioral aur integration tests compulsory honge. Missing wiring, fake-only completion, authorization bypass aur broken contracts CI ko fail karenge. Tests ko green dikhane ke liye disable ya weaken nahi karna hai.



Layer 4 — Exact commit verification

Save ke baad source readback, changed-file diff, targeted test results aur exact tested SHA verify honge. Agar failure hai, toh uski actual root cause fix hogi. Sirf report ya agla plan nahi diya jayega.



Yeh ek naya parallel system nahi hai. Yeh existing task authority, source contracts, ACRL impact/test/patch-verification mechanisms aur current CI ke andar implementation quality ko enforce karne ka tareeka hai.

Is approach ka base modern engineering practice se bhi align karta hai: GitHub Spec Kit requirements ko tasks, implementation aur convergence se jodta hai; OpenAI ki coding-agent guidance reusable instructions ke saath tests aur review par zor deti hai. Lekin GitHub bhi explicitly batata hai ki AI custom instructions har baar exactly follow hon, iski guarantee nahi hai. Isliye instructions ke saath automated proof zaroori hai. 
